---
title: "circuit breaker (Current Finance: Market)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check: has_circuit_break_triggered?
    q_check --> q_normal: false -- all operations allowed
    q_check --> q_blocked: true -- operations blocked

    q_normal --> q_trigger: admin: trigger_circuit_break()
    q_trigger --> q_check_not_already: assert !already_under_circuit_break
    q_check_not_already --> q_set_true: circuit_break = true
    q_set_true --> q_blocked

    q_blocked --> q_discharge: admin: discharge_circuit_break()
    q_discharge --> q_check_is_active: assert is_under_circuit_break
    q_check_is_active --> q_set_false: circuit_break = false
    q_set_false --> q_normal

    q_blocked --> q_reject: deposit, borrow, withdraw, repay, flash_loan, enter_market, liquidate all abort
    q_reject --> [*]

    note right of q_blocked
        INV-001: Circuit break blocks ALL market operations
        INV-002: Only admin can trigger and discharge
        INV-003: Stored as dynamic field bool on Market
        INV-004: Cannot trigger if already triggered, cannot discharge if not triggered
    end note
